# build artifacts
zugzwang
hce
perft_test
*.o
*.d

# the NNUE net is provided out-of-band: a symlink to gomachine's gitignored 180 MB
# prod net (../gomachine/data/nnue/kb-mirror.bin). Recreate with:
#   ln -sf ../gomachine/data/nnue/kb-mirror.bin net.nnue
net.nnue

# the opening book is provided out-of-band: a symlink to gomachine's gitignored
# 594 KB precomputed book (../gomachine/data/book.bin). Recreate with:
#   ln -sf ../gomachine/data/book.bin book.bin
book.bin

# Syzygy 3-4-5-man tablebases (939 MB, ../gomachine/data/syzygy). Recreate with:
#   ln -sf ../gomachine/data/syzygy syzygy
# Anchored to top-level only — must NOT match src/syzygy/ (the vendored Fathom source).
/syzygy

# match / test outputs
*.log
*.pgn

# pre-quantized "web format" net (src/nnue_web_format.h) — generated by
# tools/netweb_writer from net.nnue, ~90 MB, never checked in. Also the
# nnue_web_format_test scratch files.
*.web.nnue
net.web.nnue
tools/netweb_writer
test/nnue_web_format_test
test/secretqueen_test
test/.tmp_web_net*.bin

# tools/book_export build artifact — built by `make book_export`, never
# checked in (mirrors tools/netweb_writer above).
tools/book_export

# tools/tbdefend build artifact — built by `make tbdefend`, never checked in.
tools/tbdefend

# SPSA runtime checkpoint (spsa/tune.py) — resumable state, not source
spsa/state.json
spsa/state.json.tmp
spsa/__pycache__/

# compressed web-net artifacts (measurement only, never checked in)
*.web.nnue.br
*.web.nnue.gz

# wasm build artifacts (Makefile.wasm outputs) are deliberately COMMITTED, not
# ignored — see the note in Makefile.wasm. They total ~765 KB, change only when
# the engine source changes, and committing them is what keeps emscripten off
# the production box: the deploy just needs `git pull`. The 94 MB net is a
# different matter and stays generated (tools/netweb_writer).
test/sfnet_load_test
test/sfnet_eval_test
test/sfnet_acc_test

# sf-net experiment (Wave 5, docs/sfnet-wave5.md §A): separate playable SF-backend
# binary + its own object dir, plus the SF net itself — a symlink to 104 MB of GPLv3
# Stockfish weights (~/sf18-arm/src/nn-c288c895ea92.nnue). Never commit the net.
#   ln -sf ~/sf18-arm/src/nn-c288c895ea92.nnue sfnet.nnue
zugzwang_sfnet
objs_sfnet/
sfnet.nnue
test/sfnet_sparsity_probe
